<title>USA: Duff rates Banco Tornquist currency obligations.</title>
<headline>Duff rates Banco Tornquist currency obligations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Monday it assigned a double-B-minus rating to the long-term foreign currency obligations of Banco Tornquist SA of Argentina.</p>
<p>Duff said the the rating reflects the bank's balance sheet liquidity and management's commitment to improve the institution.</p>
<p>The rating also reflects the strength of the bank's shareholder,  O'Higgins Central Hispanoamericano SA, which is a holding comapny for a number of banks in Chile, Peru, Uruguay and Paraguay.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
